#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:15
msgid "Qt Creator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:17
msgid ""
"The `Qt Creator <https://github.com/qtproject/qt-creator>`_ is an open "
"source cross-platform integrated development environment. The editor "
"includes such features as syntax highlighting for various languages, project "
"manager, integrated version control systems, rapid code navigation tools and "
"code autocompletion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:19
msgid ""
"Refer to the `Qt-creator Manual <http://doc.qt.io/qtcreator/>`_ page for "
"more detailed information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:25
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:28
msgid "Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:30
msgid "Integration process consists of these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:32
msgid "Open system Terminal and install :ref:`piocore`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:33
msgid "Create new folder for your project and change directory (``cd``) to it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:34
msgid ""
"Generate a project using PlatformIO Core Project Generator (:option:`pio "
"project init --ide`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:35
msgid "Import project in IDE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:39
msgid "Project Generator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:41
msgid ""
"The generator will create a [Qt Creator generic project](https://doc.qt.io/"
"qtcreator/creator-project-generic.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:43
msgid ""
"Choose board ``ID`` using :ref:`cmd_boards` or `Embedded Boards Explorer "
"<https://platformio.org/boards>`_ command and generate project via :option:"
"`pio project init --ide` command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:53
msgid "Then:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:55
msgid ""
"Import project via ``File > Open File or Project`` and select ``platformio."
"creator`` from the folder where is located :ref:`projectconf`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:57
msgid ""
"Switch to ``Edit`` mode (left panel) and open source file from ``src`` "
"directory (``*.c, *.cpp, *.ino, etc.``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:59
msgid "Build project: ``Menu: Build > Build All``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/qtcreator.rst:62
msgid ""
"The libraries which are added, installed or used in the project after "
"generating process won't be reflected in IDE. To fix it you need to "
"reinitialize project using :ref:`cmd_project_init` (repeat it)."
msgstr ""
